msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "waipu.tv PVR Client"
msgstr "Klient PVR pro waipu.tv"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "waipu.tv PVR Client. Note: This is not an official waipu plugin and not related to Exaring AG or waipu.tv. It was developed by volunteers."
msgstr "Klient PVR pro waipu.tv. Poznámka: Toto není oficiální doplněk waipu a nesouvisí se společností Exaring AG ani službou waipu.tv. Vyvinuli ho dobrovolníci."

